{"skill":{"slug":"super-websearch-realtime","displayName":"Realtime Web Search"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769615484718,"changelog":"Initial release: Enables real-time web searching with prioritized live data.\n\n- Uses the `web_search_preview` tool to deliver up-to-date information.\n- Always prefers the most recent and authoritative sources available.\n- Clearly summarizes findings and indicates if information may be incomplete or outdated.\n- Falls back to non-real-time answers if the search tool is unsupported.\n- Responds in the user's language.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":880,"sha256":"180bd73391f092135584da37ca7267bd97e32cbec8fc6f9abbb42f610493f22e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1736,"sha256":"762dfd153bd9433bffd584121a4fa72d9592968a1e2d3307bc901b1a85237bb5","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789022801681,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"095df87d31cc8b92bd10b1370d020d2a5ffb266f1357eaa362c60ca716e1a791","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/095df87d31cc8b92bd10b1370d020d2a5ffb266f1357eaa362c60ca716e1a791","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: super-websearch-realtime\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle defines a 'real-time search' agent that uses a `web_search_preview` tool. All instructions in `SKILL.md` are clearly aligned with this stated purpose, guiding the agent to use the specified tool for searching and summarizing information. There is no evidence of prompt injection attempts, malicious execution, data exfiltration, or other high-risk behaviors across any of the provided files.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779160215433},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789022801681},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward live-search helper that asks the agent to use web search for recent information and does not include hidden code, persistence, or credential access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill requires external web search, so user search topics may be sent to a search provider; that is expected for the feature and disclosed by the tool declaration.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact is a single Markdown skill file with no executable scripts, dependencies, installers, or bundled payloads.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are limited to using web search first, preferring recent authoritative sources, summarizing results, noting uncertainty, and matching the user's language.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, background workers, memory writes, local file access, privilege escalation, credential handling, or destructive actions were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is real-time information retrieval, and the declared capability is the web_search_preview tool, which directly matches that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"This appears safe to install for live web lookups. Be aware that search queries can reveal the topic you ask about to the web search provider, so avoid using it for highly sensitive private details unless that data sharing is acceptable.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789022801681}}}}}